e car is a  touchscreen or a button Tesla has done a  great job of making sure we get a lot  for our money here everything from the  forward and rear cameras Wi-Fi and  navigation are included in the $70,000  base price but choose things like the  carbon fiber spoiler range upgrade and  high fidelity sound package not to  mention the ten thousand dollar  ludicrous mode and the numbers quickly  add up the price tag of the car I drove  was almost one hundred and forty  thousand dollars it's not cheap but  believe me you'll get your money's worth  and then some  you
 

